# The plushie machine's stakes: a weak pet leaves the reels of well-buttoned parts still ("needs
# rare"), a crack knocks a sewn button off, misses puff no wisps.
from after_tutorial
view full
stickers off
unlock feature:parts
dress body=bunny palette=toxic pattern=stars eyes=cyclops accessory=crown
pets 4
herd common normal 10
herd mythic normal 2
unlock tab:inventory
open-plushie
wait popup
click "show me"
wait 1
buttons body=2 palette=4 eyes=1
hopper common 1
spin
wait 0.5
expect text "needs rare"
expect text "needs mythic"
shot needs
expect fits
hopper mythic 1
spin
spin
wait 0.5
land palette=crack body=blank pattern=blank eyes=blank accessory=blank
spin
wait 0.8
shot cracked
expect fits
